# ============================================================
#  Datasets, logs, databases (regenerable or big)
# ============================================================
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.log
# Ajoutes 2026-08-14 : caches de predictions (jusqu'a ~200MB) et logs/sweeps
# regeneres a chaque run — la doc du repo les croyait deja ignores, ils ne
# l'ont jamais ete (des .csv/.pkl s'etaient retrouves trackes).
*.pkl
*.csv
g_evolution.html
backtest/modele_updown/1h/modele_team/live/regime/regime_seed.json

# Backup files of any of the above (foo.parquet.bak, foo.parquet.bak2,
# foo.parquet.bak_clean, etc). The *.parquet rule above only matches paths
# ENDING in .parquet, so .parquet.bak* leaks through without this.
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*
*.bak_*

